# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Audit reports are confidential — they name employees, vendors, invoice
# numbers and control failures. `Admin audit.pdf` is the layout reference this
# tool was built against and stays on local disks only.
#
# The blanket *.pdf rule is deliberate: this repo is public, and the whole
# point of the tool is producing audit PDFs, so an exported report must never
# be committed by accident. Use `git add -f` if you ever genuinely need one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
Admin audit.pdf

# Working files that sometimes land next to a report
*.xlsx
*.xlsb
*.xls
*.docx
*.csv
~$*

# Generated secrets, kept locally so they survive the setup steps. Never commit.
secrets.local.txt
*.local.txt
*.secret

# Wrangler / Node
.wrangler/
node_modules/
.dev.vars
.env
*.log

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
